From e07c995515ccc2deb5ddd8f33b69f1c4a0d47008 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Willian Z <willian@willian.email>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:24:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Let ZedLink connect threads from history and keep exposed
 threads loaded

- thread.attachable also lists saved, unarchived threads of configured project windows (loaded: false, updated_at), up to 200 rows.
- Attaching one loads it into that window's Agent panel in the background (active thread and selected agent unchanged) and exposes it once loaded; the attempt expires after 60 s.
- Exposed or pending threads are no longer unloaded by max_idle_retained_threads, which silently removed them from paired devices.
- project_group lists exposed folder names and up to 50 other folder names.
